sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Browser
    participant Edge as Caddy
    participant App as PlannerTool instance
    participant Broker as Shared broker
    participant Entra as Microsoft Entra ID

    User->>Browser: Open instance page
    Browser->>Edge: Request page
    Edge->>App: Forward page request
    App-->>Browser: Return page and assets
    Browser->>App: GET auth config
    App-->>Browser: Broker mode
    Browser->>App: GET current profile
    App-->>Browser: Signed out

    User->>Browser: Select Sign in
    Browser->>App: POST login begin
    App->>Broker: Begin transaction with state and PKCE challenge
    Broker-->>App: Transaction and authorization URL
    App-->>Browser: Return transaction and binding cookie
    Browser->>Broker: Open sign-in popup
    Broker-->>Browser: Redirect popup to Entra
    Browser->>Entra: Authenticate user
    Entra-->>Broker: POST authorization response to registered callback
    Broker->>Entra: Exchange authorization code
    Entra-->>Broker: Token response
    Broker->>Broker: Validate identity and store encrypted token cache
    Broker-->>Browser: Redirect to instance callback with handoff code

    Browser->>App: Complete instance callback with state and handoff code
    App->>Broker: Redeem handoff with PKCE verifier
    Broker-->>App: Verified identity and delegated grant
    App->>App: Resolve local account and create session
    App-->>Browser: Set session cookie and notify popup opener
    Browser->>App: GET current profile with session cookie
    App-->>Browser: Signed-in profile and permissions
    Browser-->>User: Active PlannerTool session